[node name="ChoirStalls" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "A 4 m run of oak choir stalls (tools/build/prop_abbey_church.py), along X, 0.7 m deep: a desk in front (-Z), six seats between shaped arms, a panelled back to 1.5 m, poppy heads on the ends to 1.7 m. The monks face -Z. Model shows one of three by where the run stands: a psalter left open and a misericord tipped up (a face under it); a candle stub run down the desk; bare (set its pick to choose; the weights spread the three over the choir's four runs). On the middle arm is a block for the candle the night scenes stand at the run's middle, 1.1 m up. The hidden Block is its collision, 1.1 m high."

